  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Korkarleh Cassava Processing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture processing (cassava) Beneficiaries: 48 (31 women) Description: The group produces cassava and with this grant will begin processing it into gari on a limited scale. The project will fund institutional, technical and management capacity building, and provide for the equipping and operation of a small cassava processing facility............Sector: Agriculture processing (cassava).Beneficiaries:.Summary: .</narrative>
